OL,3,GNEWSA'Words cannot describe losing our
OL,4,Ahome in Stourbridge wildfire'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA couple say words cannot describe how
OL,7,Fthey feel after their home was
OL,8,Fdestroyed in the Stourbridge wildfire.
OL,10,FRobin and Loxie Williams have lived at
OL,11,Fthe four-bedroom house, on Ounty John
OL,12,FLane, for 26 years and had been out
OL,13,Fwith friends last Thursday when the
OL,14,Fblaze broke out.
OL,16,FSurveying the wreckage of their home,
OL,17,Fthey told the BBC that on their return
OL,18,Fthat day they found firefighters had
OL,19,Fclosed the road and they were forced to
OL,20,Fwatch their neighbourhood going up in
OL,21,Fflames on TV.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
