OL,3,GNEWSA'Words cannot describe losing our
OL,4,Ahome in Stourbridge wildfire'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Somebody sent us a clip, which we
OL,7,Fcouldn't believe," said Loxie, 78.
OL,8,F"When you saw those flames coming out
OL,9,Fof the top you just couldn't believe
OL,10,Fit."
